{"ref":"BDB, אֶבְרָה","hw":"אֶבְרָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבְרָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. pinion</strong> (nom. unit., poet.) of ostrich <a data-ref=\"Job 39:13\" href=\"/Job.39.13\">Jb 39:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבְרָתוֹ</span> of eagle, sim. for <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.11\">Dt 32:11</a>; metaph. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 91:4\" href=\"/Psalms.91.4\">ψ 91:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבְרוֹתֶיהָ</span> of dove <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:14\" href=\"/Psalms.68.14\">ψ 68:14</a>; (all ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כּנף</span>).","next":"BDB, אָבַר","prev":"BDB, אֵ֫בֶר"}